Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.72,0:00:03.19,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Do you have body wipes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.19,0:00:04.19,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.19,0:00:05.80,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Ugh, I've got a run.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:08.28,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Hurry, before Yamabuki-kun gets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:10.10,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,He can wait outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:13.03,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Wait, did we lock the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:15.80,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,N...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:17.71,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,No! Are you all stupid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:20.46,Main,GIRLS,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.35,0:00:24.41,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,How could you change \Nwith the door unlocked?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.41,0:00:27.58,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Photos last forever in \Nthis day and age, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.58,0:00:31.36,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Aren't you high school girls? \NLock the door if it's embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:33.04,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Why are {\i1}we{\i0} getting yelled at?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:34.08,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:36.28,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We messed up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.28,0:00:38.43,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,First apologize \Nfor walking in on us, perv!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.43,0:00:40.85,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You're the pervs for changing \Nwithout a care in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.85,0:00:44.14,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Where do you get off going on \Nthe attack after walking in on us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.55,0:00:45.61,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That said...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.61,0:00:49.21,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I still want to apologize \Nfor seeing what I did! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.21,0:00:51.19,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You're a real roller coaster, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.19,0:00:53.57,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,This is my first time \Nseeing someone kowtow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.08,0:01:00.92,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Applications for gym equipment \Nare due this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.92,0:01:04.62,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That's all for the after-school broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:06.55,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Please take care on your way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.77,0:01:09.26,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,That's a wrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:11.39,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I flubbed my lines again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.39,0:01:13.53,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Let's go eat something sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.53,0:01:15.20,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Want to join us, Yamabuki-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:16.89,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I already have plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.35,0:01:20.50,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Oh, really? That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:23.67,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,If you're going to cry about it, \NI can join you remotely.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.67,0:01:26.00,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't feel \Nthat strongly about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:27.47,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Be seeing you, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.09,0:01:31.92,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Guess it's just the four of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:33.63,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I want ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.95,0:01:36.99,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What's up, Nene-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.44,0:01:38.70,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Let's tail him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.70,0:01:39.45,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.45,0:01:40.70,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Where'd that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.70,0:01:43.60,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I mean, he saw us half-naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.60,0:01:46.88,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,It won't be fair unless we get to \Nsee him in a compromising position, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.88,0:01:49.49,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,If we tail him, I'm sure \Nhe'll slip up somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.49,0:01:51.78,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It wasn't that embarrassing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.78,0:01:54.47,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Yeah, because you were hidden behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.47,0:01:56.76,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,He pretty much saw me \Nin my birthday avatar!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.08,0:01:58.78,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Is this the right thing to do, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.78,0:02:00.48,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,It does sound fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.48,0:02:02.94,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I am kinda interested in his private life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.94,0:02:05.77,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Okay, that's three against one. \NWe have a majority.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.88,0:02:10.15,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,The "Catch Yamabuki with \NHis Pants Down" Alliance is born!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.51,0:02:14.29,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,We'll get some dirt on him \Nand put him at our beck and call!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.29,0:02:16.28,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Can't say I'm a fan of the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.32,0:02:32.59,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.59,0:02:35.98,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,We want blackmail photos of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.98,0:02:37.81,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,If he's reading a porn mag...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.10,0:02:40.14,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}HOW TO TEACH TODDLERS JAPANESE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:40.14,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.14,0:02:42.28,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.39,0:02:46.40,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,We're pretty far out in the suburbs now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:48.60,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I feel like a detective! How exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:50.48,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You're getting into this, Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:53.09,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I just know he's going to \Na shady establishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.09,0:02:55.15,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Is he going to study?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.15,0:02:59.38,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Here we go! \NHe's gonna watch porn in the café!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:00.86,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Why are you so giddy about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.86,0:03:02.29,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Let's go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.29,0:03:04.57,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I hope they have matcha ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.57,0:03:06.24,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What do I order?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:08.21,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Make sure he doesn't spot us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.70,0:03:13.75,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Where's Yamabuki-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.60,0:03:16.31,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I don't see him...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.38,0:03:18.43,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.43,0:03:20.91,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Let me know when you're ready to order.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.91,0:03:22.05,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.77,0:03:27.14,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Wait, why's he working here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.14,0:03:29.29,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,He's a rich kid, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:31.15,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Did he lie about his background?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:32.59,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Big scandal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.59,0:03:33.91,Main,BOSS,0,0,0,,Yamabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.61,0:03:37.57,Main,BOSS,0,0,0,,Sorry to put you on \Nso many shifts this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.57,0:03:39.03,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,If anything, I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:40.98,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I really need the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.98,0:03:42.71,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,So he is broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.71,0:03:44.54,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,He's a ruined noble!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:45.54,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Noble...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:48.51,Main,BOSS,0,0,0,,But aren't you rich?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.51,0:03:49.46,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.46,0:03:53.74,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,My father's the one who's rich. \NI'm just a high schooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.74,0:03:56.99,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I try to earn the money I need by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.99,0:03:58.69,Main,BOSS,0,0,0,,Good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.69,0:04:01.21,Main,BOSS,0,0,0,,What's the money for, by the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.21,0:04:03.39,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,My club's audio equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:05.46,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I need a million yen or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.46,0:04:07.12,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,He talked about that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:09.95,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,But didn't he say he made \Na million on the stock market?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.95,0:04:12.98,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Maybe he lied to us so we'd agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:16.36,Main,BOSS,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to be \Nspending that much on a club?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.53,0:04:20.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,True, it is just a club.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:22.60,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,And the equipment may \Nbe wasted on those four.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.60,0:04:23.58,Main,BOSS,0,0,0,,Those four?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.06,0:04:26.85,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Frankly, I was sorely \Ndisappointed in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.25,0:04:30.61,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But they're trying to \Nchange for the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.61,0:04:32.98,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,So I want to invest in their potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.72,0:04:38.23,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Their voices have something \Nspecial about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.59,0:04:47.62,Main,BOSS,0,0,0,,Are you in love with them or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:49.29,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why would you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.29,0:04:51.65,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm speaking purely as a member \Nof the broadcasting club...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.65,0:04:53.27,Main,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Excuse us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:56.73,Main,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Can you take our order?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.73,0:04:57.74,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.17,0:05:00.84,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.84,0:05:03.21,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,You look good in that apron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.37,0:05:05.86,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:08.37,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We dug up some major dirt on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.37,0:05:10.83,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,My phone can take pics in 8K!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.83,0:05:12.58,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Shame if something happened to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:22.59,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING ROOM (TEMP)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:23.12,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.12,0:05:25.45,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,They found out about my job!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.45,0:05:28.47,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Apollo has even more \Nblackmail material on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.85,0:05:31.66,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Furin High doesn't allow part-time jobs...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:34.89,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Heya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.89,0:05:37.73,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Kirino? There's still time \Nuntil the evening broadcast...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:39.92,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Don't tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:43.73,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You're here to blackmail me over my job?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.73,0:05:45.51,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I don't negotiate with criminals!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.51,0:05:49.30,Main - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,For I carry the honor \Nof the Yamabuki Group!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.06,0:05:51.10,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I saw an embarrassing side of you, Bucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:54.29,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,It won't be fair unless I show you mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.75,0:06:01.17,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING ROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.45,0:06:02.03,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hold it. Why did you just lock the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.76,0:06:06.99,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I mean, you said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.94,0:06:16.94,Main,EPTITLEA SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}"LOCK THE DOOR IF IT'S EMBARRASSING."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:58.30,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You keep your tablet in there? \NDoesn't it get in the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.30,0:07:59.33,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.70,0:08:02.20,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,So, what about the tablet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:07.22,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,This is embarrassing to talk about, \Nbut I figured I could ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.12,0:08:11.22,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Hey, could you give me some advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:18.89,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I see. Your view count \Nhas hit a wall recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.89,0:08:24.86,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}SAME AS YESTERDAY - NEED MORE VARIETY\NTHIS IS GETTING STALE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.38,0:08:22.27,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I never got these comments before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:24.86,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,People might be getting bored of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.86,0:08:28.57,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}HELLO-IKO!\NYOU'RE AS CUTE AS EVER TODAY!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.57,0:08:29.07,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}THIS STREAM HAS ENDED
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.21,0:08:26.17,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Unsurprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.17,0:08:29.07,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Anyone would get bored of streams \Nwith nothing but "Hello" and "Bye."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.64,0:08:32.05,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I-I only do that during break times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.05,0:08:35.89,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I do karaoke, gaming, \Nchatting, and cooking streams.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.89,0:08:38.19,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I even do drawing streams sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.19,0:08:41.08,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm the one who drew \NIkon's avatar, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:45.90,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,To tell the truth, I already know \Nwhy you've hit a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:46.71,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:51.29,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I watched pretty much all \Nof your streams, so there's no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.29,0:08:54.33,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You watched it all? Every bit of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:57.89,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yes. I positively devoured \Neverything you put out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.67,0:09:01.48,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You super-dirty voyeur!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:04.40,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wait, why? You made it all public!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.06,0:09:07.86,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's good that you're doing a variety \Nof content, but take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.86,0:09:09.34,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,Hello-Iko. I'm Ikonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.34,0:09:12.24,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,We've got a karaoke stream today. \NHope you enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:14.38,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,It's my birthday today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:18.33,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,Thank you for all the comments! \NThey really made me happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.33,0:09:21.83,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,Eek, a zombie! \NI'm really bad with horror!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:25.88,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,I'm singing today. \NCan you tell how nervous I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.88,0:09:29.63,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,I'm in a great mood because \NI did well on my exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.63,0:09:31.24,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your face looks the same every time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.24,0:09:32.27,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Not so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.27,0:09:34.34,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your avatar's too lifeless!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:36.48,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,Can you tell how excited I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:37.68,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Like hell anyone can!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.07,0:09:42.56,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your avatar barely qualifies as animated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.56,0:09:47.27,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You can do so much more \Nwith 2D drawings these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.27,0:09:49.93,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,By altering or switching individual parts,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.93,0:09:52.94,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,they can be just \Nas expressive as 3D models.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.94,0:09:55.66,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,There's software that can \Nanimate flat images, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.48,0:10:00.46,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I know that, but I suck at computer stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:02.71,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,And commissioning someone isn't cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.71,0:10:03.92,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Kirino...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.92,0:10:05.87,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Who do you think the man before you is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.87,0:10:06.87,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Errand boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.87,0:10:08.85,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'd forgotten about that title.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.78,0:10:13.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Let yours truly handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.63,0:10:16.20,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I happen to be an expert \Nwith most computer software.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:18.10,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I-I'm saving so much money!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.10,0:10:19.89,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Don't say that out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:21.73,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You've got work to do, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.14,0:10:25.19,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Separate your avatar \Ninto layers and redraw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.65,0:10:28.41,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We're going to be busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:35.57,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}IKON 2.0 DEBUT STREAM PLANNING MEETING!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.05,0:10:37.45,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The wait is over, Kirino!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.87,0:10:42.63,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's time to debut VTuber \NSumeragi Ikon's 2.0 model!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.06,0:10:44.71,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.32,0:10:47.21,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I don't see anything different.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.59,0:10:49.86,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your avatar still has the same look, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.86,0:10:52.34,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But it got a major \Noverhaul under the hood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.75,0:10:57.30,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It can now track your facial expressions\N and display a rich variety of emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:10:59.95,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Let's give it a shot. Try laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.95,0:11:00.97,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.40,0:11:04.43,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Wahaha! How amusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.72,0:11:08.84,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Can you maybe... put some heart into it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.19,0:11:10.61,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I am, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:14.32,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Listen, Kirino.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.62,0:11:17.99,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your viewers want to connect \Nwith you on an emotional level.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:21.44,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You can make your avatar smile \Nwith the click of a button,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:22.58,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,but that's not the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:26.92,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,They want to see you laugh \Nor get angry for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.51,0:11:29.75,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I always have a smile during my streams.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.75,0:11:31.50,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it's fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.88,0:11:33.51,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Show more emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.88,0:11:40.10,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I can't. \NI'm not good at expressing myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:41.26,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Oho?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:49.31,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Can you still say that when I do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.31,0:11:51.52,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,E-Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.52,0:11:54.15,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Nobody wants a streamer \Nwith a poker face!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.15,0:11:56.36,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,They want to see your emotions explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.36,0:11:58.15,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Now, lay it all bare!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.94,0:12:00.95,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Stop tickling me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.99,0:12:02.14,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I hate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.83,0:12:06.62,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}FAIR
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.55,0:12:09.00,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You just laughed, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:10.38,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm not... laughing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.38,0:12:12.39,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Now you're just being stubborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.39,0:12:13.71,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.71,0:12:14.76,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:17.83,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Give it up...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.94,0:12:34.23,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That's it. \NThat's what your fans want to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.91,0:12:37.11,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You've got such a cute smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.06,0:12:40.71,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,If you can do this on stream...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.71,0:12:41.97,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.73,0:12:45.87,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What're you doing to Iko?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.14,0:12:48.68,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,The door's locked, and nobody \Nanswered when we knocked,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:51.54,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,so we took a peek in case \Nsomeone had passed out inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.89,0:12:53.18,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.18,0:12:55.42,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh? Is Iko being pounced on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.99,0:12:59.38,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Open the door already!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:00.88,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,This will be a pain to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.38,0:13:03.85,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Iko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.15,0:13:06.43,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Why are your clothes all a mess?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.43,0:13:08.81,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,It's nothing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.77,0:13:14.44,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,All he did was touch me all over \Nand then pin me to the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.44,0:13:16.61,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Wha? What the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.61,0:13:19.80,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I see. It does sound bad \Nwhen you put it into words.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.80,0:13:22.90,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Japanese is such a deep language.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.90,0:13:24.70,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Yeah, you stop philosophizing right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:27.09,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I'm taking you to the police station.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.09,0:13:28.09,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm under arrest?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.80,0:13:30.00,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Bucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.20,0:13:32.83,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.76,0:13:39.21,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Listen, Iko.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.21,0:13:43.39,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,VTubers gain popularity when \Ntheir real selves shine through.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:45.78,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Remember that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.78,0:13:46.89,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.39,0:13:50.90,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Don't worry. You were able to \Nput on a lovely smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.90,0:13:54.19,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Go out and show them what \Nyour new avatar can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.52,0:13:55.97,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.97,0:13:59.76,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to give my viewers \Na genuine smile on tomorrow's stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.76,0:14:01.69,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Good. I have high hopes for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.11,0:14:05.49,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,How can you act all cool \Nwhen you're tied up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.14,0:14:13.44,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Whatcha watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.44,0:14:15.13,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,Sumeragi Ikon-chan's livestream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.13,0:14:19.11,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,Apparently, she's got a new, \Nmore expressive avatar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.80,0:14:21.30,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}SUMERAGI IKON VER. 2.0 DEBUT STREAM!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.11,0:14:20.71,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Wow, lemme see!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:24.08,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,Hello-Iko! I'm Ikonic!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.08,0:14:28.90,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,This is Sumeragi Ikon, \Nassertive shy girl VTuber.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.90,0:14:30.41,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:35.48,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}159 WATCHING NOW
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.14,0:14:35.49,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Uh, I don't see much of a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.49,0:14:38.49,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hey, Iko! \NWhy are you even stiffer than usual?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.49,0:14:40.11,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You're making the new avatar pointless!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.11,0:14:42.15,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}WHAT CHANGED?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.11,0:14:42.15,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I... I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.15,0:14:44.15,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:49.91,Main,EPTITLEB SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}"I CAN'T SMILE IN FRONT OF THE CAMERA!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.01,0:14:52.91,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,T-Today...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.91,0:14:55.92,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm debuting my new avatar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.19,0:15:00.39,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Um, thank you all for coming to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.89,0:15:02.55,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,How...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.55,0:15:06.18,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,How do you like my new avatar?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.71,0:15:09.01,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,What part of this is new, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.01,0:15:10.34,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.34,0:15:12.93,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,I thought it'd be cuter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:14.68,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,Did she just clickbait?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.68,0:15:20.69,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You see, I drew a lot of \Nnew art for this avatar...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.05,0:15:23.47,Italics,ARISU/INT,0,0,0,,She did fine just yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.47,0:15:25.97,Italics,ARISU/INT,0,0,0,,It's not that she can't show emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.97,0:15:28.70,Italics,ARISU/INT,0,0,0,,She just can't do it in front of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.15,0:15:32.23,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.23,0:15:36.42,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Did I mess up the settings or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:40.88,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm such a klutz.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.46,0:15:39.46,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}156 WATCHING NOW
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.47,0:15:45.75,Italics,ARISU/INT,0,0,0,,But I didn't expect her \Nto freeze up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:48.09,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}146 WATCHING NOW
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.09,0:15:53.13,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,O-Oh, just give me some time, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.76,0:15:56.15,Italics,ARISU/INT,0,0,0,,Did she have a bad \Nexperience in the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.85,0:15:59.67,Italics,ARISU/INT,0,0,0,,Oh, well. Time to start the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.67,0:16:02.29,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Bye-Iko to everyone leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:03.74,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:13.58,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}SMILE!!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.58,0:16:16.18,Italics,IKO/INT,0,0,0,,Ugh, I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.18,0:16:19.87,Italics,IKO/INT,0,0,0,,It feels like everyone's \Nstaring at me up close!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.87,0:16:22.63,Italics,IKO/INT,0,0,0,,It's making my face go all stiff!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:19.87,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}121 WATCHING NOW
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.38,0:16:26.88,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}IS IT TIME FOR THE LAST RESORT?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.05,0:16:30.89,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}IT'S SOMETHING OF A\NDRASTIC MEASURE, THOUGH.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.10,0:16:34.89,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}WHAT DO YOU SAY?\NDO YOU WANT MY HELP?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:42.28,Italics,IKO,0,0,0,,Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.53,0:16:46.23,Italics,IKO,0,0,0,,Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:50.32,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}YOU GOT IT
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.62,0:16:59.46,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.39,0:17:03.39,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,And that's the stream paused.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.39,0:17:04.39,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.28,0:17:06.84,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.23,0:17:08.40,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Whew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.40,0:17:10.82,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing, Bucky?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:12.64,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You can't just stop \Na livestream like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.64,0:17:14.72,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,People were watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.72,0:17:17.22,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your viewers were dropping \Nlike flies, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.22,0:17:19.09,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Calm down for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.09,0:17:20.81,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Take a good look at yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.81,0:17:23.21,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You're all sweaty from the nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:26.02,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Take some clothes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.02,0:17:27.78,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You hyper-dirty perv.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.78,0:17:29.54,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hyper is fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.54,0:17:31.42,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Just take them off before you get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.31,0:17:41.55,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm so disappointed in you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:46.38,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Goodness. All your big words \Nbefore the stream were just talk, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.86,0:17:49.69,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You don't have to be a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.69,0:17:53.18,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd get \Nthis nervous either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.18,0:17:56.54,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Even so, you should've been \Nable to smile through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:18:01.21,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Is that all your dream means to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.21,0:18:04.31,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You talk like you know it all, Bucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.31,0:18:05.96,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm serious about this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:08.47,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,No, you aren't the least bit serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.47,0:18:10.47,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You're just fooling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.45,0:18:16.37,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I am serious, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.37,0:18:18.58,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I kept quiet and listened, \Nbut you're just running your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.58,0:18:19.66,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I don't know about quiet, but okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.66,0:18:22.51,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm doing my best, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.21,0:18:28.50,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I do have emotions! I'm only human!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.50,0:18:30.64,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,But... But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.64,0:18:33.19,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I can't do it! I'm too scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.19,0:18:36.72,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Just quit, then. \NYou hate streaming, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.72,0:18:40.68,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I love streaming! I don't wanna quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.68,0:18:43.54,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Do you love streaming that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.54,0:18:45.02,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What do you love about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:47.48,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Huh? Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.83,0:18:51.61,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I love being able to interact \Nwith hundreds of people, and also...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.61,0:18:52.81,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Iko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.81,0:18:53.78,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.78,0:18:55.28,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Don't give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.28,0:18:57.39,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You didn't turn off the audio!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.39,0:18:59.73,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Your whole exchange was streamed online!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.73,0:19:01.20,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Iko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.18,0:19:06.49,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I knew it! The guy was Yamabuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.49,0:19:08.36,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,It's all over for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.44,0:19:11.51,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Anyway, take a look at your stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.51,0:19:14.26,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,No... I know I'm getting canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.26,0:19:15.47,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Forget canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.47,0:19:17.39,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You've got a whole wave \Nof people tuning in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.47,0:19:17.39,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}2,041 WATCHING NOW
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.39,0:19:21.02,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Huh? Why? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.02,0:19:24.09,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Why don't you give your \Nviewers an explanation?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:28.23,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Wait... I can't talk to so many people!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.85,0:19:28.23,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}2,165 WATCHING NOW
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.42,0:19:31.38,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Iko.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.11,0:19:33.61,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yesterday, I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.61,0:19:38.49,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,"VTubers gain popularity when \Ntheir real selves shine through."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.49,0:19:40.33,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That wasn't entirely accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.52,0:19:42.73,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,To be more accurate,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.73,0:19:46.54,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,they gain popularity when they \Naccidentally reveal their true selves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:50.39,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You can tell what your viewers \Nwant to hear right now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.62,0:19:54.32,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Now, go end the stream on a good note.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.31,0:20:15.57,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,Forget-It-All Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.57,0:20:17.28,Main,BOYS,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.28,0:20:18.19,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,Cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.19,0:20:19.66,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Love the gap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:22.20,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BEAM!! - GIMME MORE!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.20,0:20:25.41,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,I-I'm ending the stream here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.41,0:20:27.91,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}TODAY'S STREAM HAS ENDED
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:45.22,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}SUMERAGI IKON'S PRIVATE STREAM
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:45.22,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Iko's private stream?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.71,0:20:49.15,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why couldn't she just call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.80,0:20:53.36,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,Heya, Bucky. Is now a good time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.36,0:20:55.73,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm just in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.73,0:20:58.11,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,You call that a good time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.64,0:21:01.33,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,I realized I didn't thank you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.33,0:21:04.83,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,So I figured I could do it \Nwith my new avatar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.83,0:21:05.95,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Thank me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.32,0:21:09.00,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,All I did was talk down to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.27,0:21:11.17,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I know what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.17,0:21:15.23,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You left the stream running \Nand made me mad on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.23,0:21:17.76,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Whatever do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.76,0:21:19.80,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm still a bit scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.05,0:21:25.93,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,But I'll try to be myself more from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.89,0:21:30.31,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Could be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.36,0:21:33.69,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your new avatar is pretty good and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.08,0:21:37.63,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,but it doesn't compare \Nto your real smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.57,0:21:42.45,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hey, it went back to a poker face!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.76,0:21:44.91,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Was all our effort today in vain?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.91,0:21:47.22,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hello? Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.72,0:21:51.87,Italics,IKO/INT,0,0,0,,Oh no... Hiding my face \Nblocks the tracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.87,0:21:55.33,Italics,IKO/INT,0,0,0,,H-Huh? This is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.33,0:21:59.84,Italics,IKO/INT,0,0,0,,I thought I could smile for Bucky now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.84,0:22:01.51,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.55,0:22:05.01,Italics,IKO/INT,0,0,0,,But when he looks at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.34,0:22:06.93,Italics,IKO/INT,0,0,0,,my face gets hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.93,0:22:09.93,Main,EPTITLEC SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}"I CAN'T SMILE IN FRONT OF YOU...!"
